984465_922436058102935_3341417799611318272_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rld886zeWqIQ7kNvwHZ_9Od&_nc_oc=AdnjN9KEPTCAP0J9mz8XTzXK-m8otdFg1-nwxcWQ4z1EHq2wVvhUXSvcG2jkGpqoRUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvzn93LU7wSNYnhr8K7UhM3Gvr01j-GHlxvJRR5_ubJhw&oe=69A2F7AB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "292267735074768", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974807_417303695555060_4524306369079148544_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ttl04D4qdWUQ7kNvwF9o9zN&_nc_oc=Adlx2q54wkx7RdQl1AZxH0Qqa8w7PAiez5jykUGNRFQF0Z7bR7bE133J7xqffm40tzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvGGOi7_D4XrwZPdQJWXFUbFrfl4l054leo9fVyrTiBMg&oe=69A2D417"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "797510141076518", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982567_947921238877623_7393278208512098304_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zXnSxGj-KukQ7kNvwE3NOT0&_nc_oc=AdkYbbk5Zex7WwB1WR3ilY7KFH9sQAT3dmasBN_vDCcvRAL8ylWX_Og10p8inuwWfG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuS_XtnFMgEjosB23Nk2S0jfG5--t5Un-Uv8Ym37wavoQ&oe=69A2C8E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Half + Half", "keywords": ["multiplayer", "locomotion", "voice", "chat", "chill"], "long_description": "Half + Half is a multiplayer game about fun & connection. The game includes five unique multiplayer spaces that are designed to help you connect with people you know, and also to connect with people you don\u2019t, even if only for a short while.\n\nSwim in the ocean. Glide through clouds. Play human tetris with friends, or Hide & Seek where hiders are two inches tall, and seekers are as tall as buildings.\n\nEvery space in Half + Half is designed to be fun, but also to make you look as ridiculous as possible in real life. Half + Half is made to be fun for you, but also fun for everyone in the same room.", "short_description": "Half + Half is a multipla